WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.411
Point your phone at the ground, or
look straight down.

00:00:03.861 --> 00:00:05.452
The ground has gone clear.

00:00:05.902 --> 00:00:12.107
What you see is the far side of the
planet, 12,742 km away, through the

00:00:12.107 --> 00:00:13.855
middle of the Earth.
